{"id":"vod_lz_53749","vodId":"53749","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"光能使者","name_cn":"光能使者","date":"1989-01-01","year":"1989","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20230313-1/002926c615afbbf684912fe760cda527.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的月球之上，彼时，那里已经变成了适宜人类居住的星球。某日，来月球旅行的遥大地（松冈洋子 配音）邂逅了名为“兔人”的月球种族，他们告诉遥大地，他们位于月球内层的星球遭到了邪动族的侵略都和霸占，为此，他们踏上了寻找能够对抗邪动族的勇士的旅程。　　让兔人们没有想到的是，遥大地竟然就是他们要找的光明魔动战士，通过魔法阵，遥大地召唤出了地之魔动王。之后，召唤出风之魔动王的山本加斯（松田辰也 配音），召唤出水之魔动王的玛利乌斯（安达忍 配音）等人纷纷登场，一行人来到了圣地路那，准备在那里展开一段惊心动魄的奇幻旅程。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-03-13 08:22:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":41,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12372_03c567ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12371_70ed6811/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12374_78ba4cd4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12373_3e8417cc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12375_262f8000/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12379_3ea174fe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12380_002947ba/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12377_f313b620/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12376_54679ef8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12378_26039bdf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12381_d35f87a3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12382_2195afaa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12383_babe861c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip.lz-cdn16.com/20230312/12385_32fc6c2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vip.lz-c